        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Dawn - A journey to the beginning of the solar system</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #000000;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .poster-container {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    max-width: 1450px;\n    width: 100%;\n    gap: 30px;\n  }\n\n  /* Column Layout */\n  .col-left {\n    flex: 0 0 28%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n\n  .col-center {\n    flex: 0 0 38%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .col-right {\n    flex: 0 0 28%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n\n  /* Typography */\n  .main-title {\n    font-size: 58px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #00addc;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-align: left;\n    width: 100%;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .subtitle {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #00addc;\n    margin: 8px 0 20px 0;\n    text-align: left;\n    width: 100%;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-style: normal;\n    color: #00addc;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .desc {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n  }\n\n  .center-desc {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 25px 20px;\n  }\n\n  .url {\n    font-size: 38px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #00addc;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  /* Content Block Sections */\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .flex-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .text-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n\n  /* Profiles & Photos */\n  .person-profile {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    width: max-content;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .person-title {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  /* Placeholders */\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #666666;\n    background-color: #141414;\n    color: #a0a0a0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-style: normal;\n  }\n\n  .portrait {\n    width: 85px;\n    height: 85px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    padding: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .instrument-photo {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .main-diagram {\n    width: 480px;\n    height: 480px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding: 40px;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(0, 173, 220, 0.1);\n  }\n\n  /* CSS Flags (Visual Footprints) */\n  .flag {\n    width: 27px;\n    height: 17px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #555555;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .flag.de {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #000000 33.3%, #dd0000 33.3%, #dd0000 66.6%, #ffce00 66.6%);\n  }\n  .flag.it {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #009246 33.3%, #ffffff 33.3%, #ffffff 66.6%, #ce2b37 66.6%);\n  }\n  .flag.us {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #b22234 14.2%, #ffffff 14.2%, #ffffff 28.5%, #b22234 28.5%, #b22234 42.8%, #ffffff 42.8%, #ffffff 57.1%, #b22234 57.1%, #b22234 71.4%, #ffffff 71.4%, #ffffff 85.7%, #b22234 85.7%);\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .flag.us::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 45%;\n    height: 57%;\n    background: #3c3b6e;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"poster-container\">\n  \n  <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n  <div class=\"col-left\">\n    \n    <!-- Framing Cameras -->\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <h2>Framing Cameras <span class=\"flag de\" title=\"Germany\"></span></h2>\n      <div class=\"flex-row\">\n        <div class=\"text-col\">\n          <p class=\"desc\">By imaging the surfaces of Vesta and Ceres, the framing cameras will enable scientists to map the topography, albedo and color, and to determine their shapes, volumes, and spin rates.</p>\n          <div class=\"person-profile\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">[Photo: Holger Sierks]</div>\n            <div class=\"person-title\">Holger Sierks<br>Framing Camera Lead, MPS</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder instrument-photo\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 260px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n          [Instrument: Framing Camera]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Gamma Ray Neutron Detector -->\n    <div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 40px;\">\n      <h2>Gamma Ray Neutron Detector <span class=\"flag us\" title=\"USA\"></span></h2>\n      <div class=\"flex-row\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder instrument-photo\" style=\"width: 185px; height: 310px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n          [Instrument: GRaND]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-col\">\n          <p class=\"desc\">GRaND measures elemental abundances on the surfaces of Vesta and Ceres, offering insight into their respective formation and evolution</p>\n          <div class=\"person-profile\" style=\"margin-top: auto; align-self: flex-start; margin-left: 10px;\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">[Photo: Tom Prettyman]</div>\n            <div class=\"person-title\">Tom Prettyman<br>GRaND Team Lead, PSI</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- CENTER COLUMN -->\n  <div class=\"col-center\">\n    <div style=\"width: 100%;\">\n      <h1 class=\"main-title\">Dawn</h1>\n      <div class=\"subtitle\">A journey to the beginning of the solar system</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder main-diagram\">\n      [Diagram: Protoplanet Vesta/Ceres with Dawn spacecraft orbiter trajectory in red and yellow scanning beam]\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"center-desc\">In its journey to the main asteroid belt to orbit two diverse protoplanets, Vesta and Ceres, Dawn is carrying a suite of sophisticated scientific instruments to collect data that will inform us about the early formation of our solar system.</p>\n      <div class=\"url\">http://dawn.jpl.nasa.gov</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n  <div class=\"col-right\">\n    \n    <!-- Gravity Science -->\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <h2>Gravity Science <span class=\"flag us\" title=\"USA\"></span></h2>\n      <div class=\"flex-row\">\n        <div class=\"text-col\">\n          <p class=\"desc\">Gravity science: the spacecraft transmits a radio signal to Earth through its high gain antenna that changes in frequency as the spacecraft's speed changes when flying over areas of different densities. The collective set of information on the mass variations or concentrations is called the gravitational field of the body/planet.</p>\n          <div class=\"person-profile\" style=\"align-self: center; margin-left: 30px;\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">[Photo: Sami Asmar]</div>\n            <div class=\"person-title\">Sami Asmar<br>Gravity Science Lead, JPL</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder instrument-photo\" style=\"width: 155px; height: 270px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n          [Diagram: Spacecraft High Gain Antenna & Arrays]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Visible & Infrared Spectrometer -->\n    <div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 40px;\">\n      <h2>Visible & Infrared Spectrometer <span class=\"flag it\" title=\"Italy\"></span></h2>\n      <div class=\"flex-row\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder instrument-photo\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 230px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 15px;\">\n          [Instrument: VIR Spectrometer]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-col\">\n          <p class=\"desc\" style=\"text-align: right;\">VIR measures reflected sunlight and emitted thermal radiation from the targets. Scientists extract and then map mineralogical signatures and thermal properties. These properties hold clues to the history and formation mechanisms of Vesta and Ceres.</p>\n          <div class=\"person-profile\" style=\"margin-top: auto; align-self: flex-end; margin-right: 15px;\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">[Photo: Angioletta Coradini]</div>\n            <div class=\"person-title\">Angioletta Coradini,<br>VIR Team Leader, INAF</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
